OL,5,G1000 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe first visit is to the Bridge
OL,7,     FHotel in Scunthorpe, with new
OL,8,     Fowners Martin and Hannah Weaver.
OL,9,     FHow will the guests react when the
OL,10,     Fcouple's pet pig joins them at
OL,11,     Fbreakfast?
OL,12,G1035 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FMichelle and Rob Earp welcome
OL,14,     Ftheir rivals to their
OL,15,     Fanimal-packed B&B, Seashells, in
OL,16,     FSutton-on-Sea. But the
OL,17,     Fself-service breakfast drives
OL,18,     Ftheir guests wild.
