OL,6,     FTom and his stepdaughter Samara
OL,7,     Fhost at The Crown at Whitchurch in
OL,8,     FHerefordshire, where their guests
OL,9,     Fare put through their paces on an
OL,10,     Fassault course.
OL,11,G1135 Four in a Bed
OL,12,     FClare and Fran welcome their
OL,13,     Frivals to The New Court Hotel in
OL,14,     FUsk, Monmouthshire. At breakfast,
OL,15,     Fthere are pepper problems and
OL,16,     Fmissing mushrooms, and talk turns
OL,17,     Fto tactics.
