OL,5,G1210 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FIt's the final day of the
OL,7,     Fcompetition and the B&Bers meet
OL,8,     Ffor one last time to settle some
OL,9,     Fscores and find out how much
OL,10,     Fthey've been paid, before the
OL,11,     Fwinner is announced.
OL,12,G1240 Come Dine with Me
OL,13,     FKent. The first host, construction
OL,14,     Fsite manager and part-time bouncer
OL,15,     FMark, wants his night to be as
OL,16,     Fmuch about the fun as the food,
OL,17,     Fwith party poppers and confetti
OL,18,     Fcannons. (Ep1/5)
