OL,6,     FKent. Competitive sales assistant
OL,7,     FVerush hosts a Czech evening with
OL,8,     Ftraditional food. But one guest
OL,9,     Fcompares her pasta to MDF and her
OL,10,     Fpastry to leather... (Ep2/5)
OL,11,G1340 Come Dine with Me
OL,12,     FKent. Dog lover Karen hosts a
OL,13,     FBritish bulldog bonanza, with
OL,14,     Fevery course inspired by her
OL,15,     Fprecious pooches. But will she be
OL,16,     Ftop dog at the end of the
OL,17,     Fcompetition? (Ep3/5)
