OL,5,G1520 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe competition begins at The View
OL,7,     Fin Tynemouth, run by Graeme and
OL,8,     FBrenda. Their B&B has royal
OL,9,     Fhistory, but their guests don't
OL,10,     Fthink the shared bathrooms are
OL,11,     Fvery regal.
OL,12,G1550 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FVisit two is to the Northern Hotel
OL,14,     Fin Brechin, Angus, where hosts
OL,15,     FPawel and Joanna like to go the
OL,16,     Fextra mile. Things start off
OL,17,     Fbrilliantly, but a breakfast
OL,18,     Fbreakdown could be costly.
