OL,11,G1955 Grand Designs
OL,12,     FSteph and her husband Alex plan to
OL,13,     Fbuild a contemporary farmhouse on
OL,14,     FSteph's grandfather's old
OL,15,     Ffarmland. But a lack of money
OL,16,     Fleads to a long spell in a caravan
OL,17,     Fand a total redesign...
